## 6. Create the IPsec Tunnel

Navigate to Network → IPsec Tunnels.

Click Add.

### General tab

| Field                | Value               |
| -------------------- | ------------------- |
| Name                 | `IPSEC-TO-CSR`      |
| Tunnel Interface     | `tunnel.1`          |
| Type                 | Auto Key            |
| IKE Gateway          | `IKE-GW-CSR`        |
| IPSec Crypto Profile | `IPSEC-CSR-PROFILE` |

Leave the IPsec mode set to Tunnel.

Do not configure Proxy IDs for this route-based IKEv2 design.

### Tunnel Monitor

Initially, leave tunnel monitoring disabled. We'll enable it after the tunnel and routing work, using `10.255.255.2` as the destination.

Click OK.

